# sha256 of every Atlas release artifact `make tools` is allowed to install.
#
# Atlas is fetched as a bare binary from release.ariga.io and then executed. `go install` gets the
# Go checksum database for free, so sqlc needs nothing here; a curl of an opaque blob gets nothing
# at all. Pinning the URL pins a NAME, not the bytes behind it — the same version string can serve
# different bytes if the endpoint, its cache or anything in front of it changes, and `make tools`
# would mark them executable and run them. GEN001 is a required check, so whatever Atlas says would
# be trusted as the answer to "does the checked-in schema match its source".
#
# So the bytes are pinned instead, and `make tools` refuses anything that does not match. A
# platform with no line here is a refusal, not a fallback: an unlisted platform silently skipping
# verification is the hole this closes.
#
# WHAT THIS DOES AND DOES NOT BUY. Upstream publishes no signature and no provenance attestation —
# only a sibling `<artifact>.sha256` on the same host, which a compromised endpoint would serve
# consistently. These values were captured on 2026-08-18, each cross-checked against that published
# digest at capture time. That makes this trust-on-first-use: it detects the bytes CHANGING under a
# fixed version, which is the realistic failure and the one the reviewer flagged. It does not
# establish that v1.3.0 was honest on the day it was pinned. If Atlas ships signed releases or a
# cosign attestation later, verify that instead and delete this file.
#
# To bump ATLAS_VERSION in the Makefile, refresh every line:
#
#     for p in linux-amd64 linux-arm64 darwin-amd64 darwin-arm64; do
#       curl -fsSL -o "/tmp/atlas-$p" "https://release.ariga.io/atlas/atlas-$p-$VERSION"
#       shasum -a 256 "/tmp/atlas-$p" | sed "s|/tmp/atlas-$p|atlas-$p-$VERSION|"
#     done
#
# Format is what shasum writes, so `shasum -a 256 -c` reads it directly. The name is the artifact,
# not a path on disk.
cfc773e5b4e845bc01d680390c174648938a7f88bf30e5a2c83ae85217c21587  atlas-linux-amd64-v1.3.0
d2cfb1c71e58170bb4ddbe62107a38da4490f516ffa53a13abf57583819b6a40  atlas-linux-arm64-v1.3.0
4b4d8621332eabc3e6e7554d799a98ceef6376c4d8bbad6ed7832b49655e3480  atlas-darwin-amd64-v1.3.0
47aaf7c295c7569c7eecfcbc53f02de862846ce1fbef16f1bd8ae98b03c3c68f  atlas-darwin-arm64-v1.3.0
